## ✅ 实现思路

- 使用两个 `Stack<T>`：
  - `undoStack`：保存撤销的历史状态。
  - `redoStack`：保存前进的历史状态。
- 每次操作时，将当前状态压入 `undoStack`，并清空 `redoStack`。
- 撤销时，从 `undoStack` 弹出状态，压入 `redoStack`。
- 前进时，从 `redoStack` 弹出状态，压入 `undoStack`。

---

## ✅ 示例代码（支持任意类型的状态）

```csharp
using System;
using System.Collections.Generic;

public class UndoRedoManager<T>
{
    private readonly Stack<T> undoStack = new Stack<T>();
    private readonly Stack<T> redoStack = new Stack<T>();

    public void AddState(T state)
    {
        // 将当前状态压入 undoStack，清空 redoStack
        undoStack.Push(state);
        redoStack.Clear();
    }

    public T Undo()
    {
        if (undoStack.Count == 0)
            throw new InvalidOperationException("No more states to undo.");

        T state = undoStack.Pop();
        redoStack.Push(state);
        return state;
    }

    public T Redo()
    {
        if (redoStack.Count == 0)
            throw new InvalidOperationException("No more states to redo.");

        T state = redoStack.Pop();
        undoStack.Push(state);
        return state;
    }

    public T GetCurrentState()
    {
        if (undoStack.Count == 0)
            throw new InvalidOperationException("No current state.");

        return undoStack.Peek();
    }

    public bool CanUndo => undoStack.Count > 0;
    public bool CanRedo => redoStack.Count > 0;
}
```

